<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-EASTERN PROV 247-2 AT TEA AGAINST GRIQUAS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-EASTERN PROV 247-2 AT TEA AGAINST GRIQUAS.</headline>
<dateline>PORT ELIZABETH 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eastern Province reached the comfortable position of 247 for the loss of just two wickets at tea on the first day of their four-day match against Griqualand West at St George's Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Eastern Province 247-2 (Louis Koen 134 not out, Mark Rushmere 63)</p>
